flowchart LR
    STATE["Device State / Events"]
    DEV["Hubitat Device Object"]
    DR["Driver Layer"]
    APP["Application Layer"]
    SCH["Hub Scheduler"]

    subgraph EW["Physical / External World"]
        ES["External Services / Systems<br/>Cloud APIs - HA - Node-RED - Custom services"]
        OH["Other Hubitat Hub"]
    end

    subgraph HE["Hubitat Elevation Platform"]
        API["Maker API / HTTP Endpoints<br/>External integration boundary"]
        HM["Hub Mesh<br/>Shared devices + Hub Variables"]
        HV["Hub Variables<br/>Shared typed state"]
        DIAG["Operations / Diagnostics<br/>Logs - Event history - App status - Device status"]
    end

    ES -->|REST / endpoint call| API
    API -->|read / command selected devices| DEV
    STATE -.->|callback / event exposure| API

    OH -->|LAN| HM
    HM -->|shared device representation| DEV
    HM -->|variable sharing| HV

    DR -.->|logs / state| DIAG
    DEV -.->|events / status| DIAG
    APP -.->|logs / subscriptions / jobs| DIAG
    SCH -.->|scheduled jobs| DIAG
